---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Picture-first overview of the five incidents listed above. Illustrative layout, facts from the post text.
---
<figure class="rf">
  <div class="rf-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 352" role="img" aria-label="Five real incidents, each with an icon: GitHub 2018 lost 954 writes on one cluster after a failover, GitLab 2017 lost about six hours of data, Bitbucket 2020 saw new pull requests vanish from lists, Figma 2019 keeps only one of two simultaneous edits, Amazon 2007 can bring back a deleted cart item.">
    <rect x="10" y="10" width="880" height="62" rx="4" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="github" x={52} y={41} size={32} />
    <text x="94" y="37" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>GitHub, 2018</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>GitHub, 2018</tspan></text>
    <text x="94" y="57" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>43 s network cut, failover across the country</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mạng đứt 43 giây, failover sang bờ bên kia</tspan></text>
    <line x1="500" y1="20" x2="500" y2="62" class="edge " />
    <text x="520" y="46" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>954 writes never reached the new primary</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>954 lần ghi không tới primary mới</tspan></text>
    <rect x="10" y="78" width="880" height="62" rx="4" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="gitlab" x={52} y={109} size={32} />
    <text x="94" y="105" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>GitLab, 2017</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>GitLab, 2017</tspan></text>
    <text x="94" y="125" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>replica rebuilt, wrong server wiped</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dựng lại replica, xoá nhầm server</tspan></text>
    <line x1="500" y1="88" x2="500" y2="130" class="edge " />
    <text x="520" y="114" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>about 6 hours of data lost</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mất khoảng 6 tiếng dữ liệu</tspan></text>
    <rect x="10" y="146" width="880" height="62" rx="4" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="bitbucket" x={52} y={177} size={32} />
    <text x="94" y="173" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Bitbucket, 2020</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bitbucket, 2020</tspan></text>
    <text x="94" y="193" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>reads sent to a replica that lagged</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đọc từ replica đang tụt lại</tspan></text>
    <line x1="500" y1="156" x2="500" y2="198" class="edge " />
    <text x="520" y="182" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>new pull request vanished from the list</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>pull request mới biến mất khỏi danh sách</tspan></text>
    <rect x="10" y="214" width="880" height="62" rx="4" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="figma" x={52} y={245} size={32} />
    <text x="94" y="241" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Figma, 2019</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Figma, 2019</tspan></text>
    <text x="94" y="261" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>two people edit one property at once</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hai người sửa một thuộc tính cùng lúc</tspan></text>
    <line x1="500" y1="224" x2="500" y2="266" class="edge " />
    <text x="520" y="250" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>one edit wins, the other is lost</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một chỉnh sửa thắng, cái kia mất</tspan></text>
    <rect x="10" y="282" width="880" height="62" rx="4" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="package" x={52} y={313} size={32} />
    <text x="94" y="309" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Amazon, 2007</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Amazon, 2007</tspan></text>
    <text x="94" y="329" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>a cart that always accepts writes</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>giỏ hàng luôn nhận lệnh ghi</tspan></text>
    <line x1="500" y1="292" x2="500" y2="334" class="edge " />
    <text x="520" y="318" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>a deleted item can come back</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>món đã xoá có thể quay lại</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Five teams, one cause: copies of the same data drifted apart, and the cost showed up in different ways.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Năm team, một nguyên nhân: các bản sao của cùng một dữ liệu lệch nhau, và cái giá hiện ra theo nhiều kiểu khác nhau.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .rf { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .rf-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .rf svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .rf text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .rf .t-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-hs { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-b { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .t-mono { font-size: 12px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-bad { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .t-ok { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .rf .box.strong { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.empty { fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .rf .box.bad.empty { fill: none; }
  .rf .edge { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .rf .edge.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.ok { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .head.bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .rf .head.ok { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .rf figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
